  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Voluntary contribution of core funding to the Central Emergency Response Fund for 2025. &#xa0;The CERF is a key instrument for immeadiate and flexible assistance that provides life-saving humanitarian assistance, it provides assistance to over 30 million people, of which over half were women and girls, and nearly half were children under the age of 18. The CERF responds to sudden onset emergencies and neglected and underfunded crises across the word, it delivers life-saving assistance to millions of people across 41 countries.</narrative>
  </description>
